SIMPLE  =                    T / conforms to FITS standard                      BITPIX  =                    8 / array data type                                NAXIS   =                    0 / number of array dimensions                     EXTEND  =                    T                                                  AUTHOR  = 'A.Anand '                                                            SURVEY  = 'DESI    '                                                            DR      = 'DR1     '                                                            ABSORBER= 'MgII    '           / Absorber name                                  KERWIDTH= '[3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]' / Kernel width in pixels (ker_fwhm_pixels)       COEFFSIG=                    2 / sigma threshold (coeff_sigma)                  MULTRE  =                    1 / Multiplicative factor for residuals (mult_resi)D_PIX   =                  0.6 / tolerance for line separation (in Ang) (d_pix) PM_PIXEL=                  100 / N_Pixel for noise estimation (pm_pixel)        SN_LINE1=                    3 / S/N threshold for first line (sn_line1)        SN_LINE2=                    2 / S/N threshold for second line (sn_line2)       EWCOVAR =                    T / Use covariance for EW error (use_covariance)   LOGWAVE =                    F / Use log wavelength scaling (logwave)           LAM_ESEP=                   10 / lambda edges to avoid edges (lam_edge_sep)     BLUE_LAM=              1549.48 / blue end of quasar-rest frame (Ang) for search RED_LAM =             2799.117 / red end of quasar-rest frame (Ang) for search  CONTERR =                 0.05 / fractional error in continuum normalization    CONFLEV =  / minimum confidence level for selection                             DV_QSO  =                 5000 / qso velocity separation from absorber (km/s)   RWSTART =                 3600 / start wavelength for resolution curve (Ang)    RVSTART =                 2000 / resolution value at start wavelength           